  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Malaria Control in the Democratic Republic of Congo .</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce the burden of malaria in the Democratic Republic of Congo by providing essential prevention and treatment services and strengthening disease surveillance. The programme will help to protect approximately six million people from the disease, and will contribute towards the MDG&#x2019;s by reducing malaria deaths in Democratic Republic of Congo</narrative>
  </description>
